%%{init: {"theme": "base", "fontFamily": "Nunito, sans-serif", "themeVariables": {"background": "#FFFFFF", "actorBkg": "#ECECFF", "actorBorder": "#9370DB", "actorLineColor": "#9370DB", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#333333", "signalTextColor": "#333333", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ECECFF", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#9370DB", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "loopTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"mirrorActors": false, "actorMargin": 25, "width": 130, "messageMargin": 36}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant F as fix
  participant D as diagnose
  participant I as implement
  participant R as ponytail-review
  participant V as verify-ux-ui
  participant Docs as update-docs
  participant C as commit
  participant M as commit-message
  U->>F: Fix reported symptom
  F->>D: Find root cause
  D-->>F: Cause, remedy, unresolved checks
  alt Cause outside project control
    F-->>U: Diagnosis only
  else Project can fix cause
    F->>I: Implement root-cause fix
    I->>R: Review changes
    R-->>I: Findings or approval
    I->>V: If UI changed: verify
    V-->>I: Results or blocker
    I->>Docs: Update affected docs
    Docs-->>I: Changes and unresolved claims
    I->>C: If Git: commit batch
    C->>M: Write staged-change message
    M-->>C: Commit message
    C-->>I: Hash and subject
    I-->>F: Implementation report
    F-->>U: Cause and implementation report
  end
